{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/algorithm/LEET/L1202SmallestStringWithSwaps/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"frontmatter":{"title":"1202. Smallest String With Swaps","date":"December 11, 2025"},"html":"<h1>문제 설명</h1>\n<p>이 문제는 주어진 문자열과 인덱스 쌍들을 이용하여, 인덱스 쌍에 해당하는 문자들을 서로 교환할 수 있을 때, 사전순으로 가장 작은 문자열을 만드는 문제입니다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 87.00000000000001%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"1202\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/1911a4f4f3867fa4247832d08bcf68a6/5a190/1202.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/1911a4f4f3867fa4247832d08bcf68a6/772e8/1202.png 200w,\n/static/1911a4f4f3867fa4247832d08bcf68a6/e17e5/1202.png 400w,\n/static/1911a4f4f3867fa4247832d08bcf68a6/5a190/1202.png 800w,\n/static/1911a4f4f3867fa4247832d08bcf68a6/c1b63/1202.png 1200w,\n/static/1911a4f4f3867fa4247832d08bcf68a6/9f9a4/1202.png 1560w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<h2>풀이 및 해설</h2>\n<p>처음 이 문제를 접근할 때는 다음과 같이 풀어보려고 했습니다.</p>\n<ol>\n<li>모든 순서 조합을 찾아보고</li>\n<li>하나씩 문자열을 교환해본 후 가장 작은 문자열을 찾는 방식입니다.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>그러나 이런 방식에는 크게 두개 문제가 있었습니다. 일단, 첫번째 단계에서 하나의 순서 조합을 한번 이상 사용할 수 있는 문제가 있었으며, 두번째로는 두번째 단계가 너무 오래 걸릴 것으로 예상되는 점이었습니다.</p>\n<h2>시도 1</h2>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">from itertools import permutations\n\nclass Solution:\n    def smallestStringWithSwaps(self, s: str, pairs: List[List[int]]) -> str:\n        # find all possible orders\n        orders = [list(p) for p in permutations(pairs)]\n        print(orders)\n\n        # compare lexicographical orders\n        # naive brute force\n        lex_smallest_str = s\n        for order in orders:\n            curr_s = list(s)\n            for pair in order:\n                curr_s[pair[0]], curr_s[pair[1]] = curr_s[pair[1]], curr_s[pair[0]]\n            \n            curr_s = ''.join(curr_s)\n            if curr_s &#x3C; lex_smallest_str:\n                lex_smallest_str = curr_s\n        \n        return lex_smallest_str\n</code></pre>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 33%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"try1\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/40c5fde4e611fdd4ad6ae1cfbbd56bbb/5a190/try1.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/40c5fde4e611fdd4ad6ae1cfbbd56bbb/772e8/try1.png 200w,\n/static/40c5fde4e611fdd4ad6ae1cfbbd56bbb/e17e5/try1.png 400w,\n/static/40c5fde4e611fdd4ad6ae1cfbbd56bbb/5a190/try1.png 800w,\n/static/40c5fde4e611fdd4ad6ae1cfbbd56bbb/c1b63/try1.png 1200w,\n/static/40c5fde4e611fdd4ad6ae1cfbbd56bbb/29007/try1.png 1600w,\n/static/40c5fde4e611fdd4ad6ae1cfbbd56bbb/93ba6/try1.png 2874w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<p>역시 예상대로 하나 이상의 순서 조합을 사용할 경우 정확한 답을 구할 수 없습니다.</p>\n<h2>시도 2</h2>\n<p>그래프로 표현하면 풀리는 문제다. 신기하게 DFS로 서로 이어져 있는 노드들을 찾고, 이렇게 했을 경우 서로 순회하는 노드들 간의 가장 작은 문자열을 각각 찾아서 해당 위치에 넣어주면 됩니다.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 35%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"try2\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/768a60aa512b34bb0c8b81652d5cfe1b/5a190/try2.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/768a60aa512b34bb0c8b81652d5cfe1b/772e8/try2.png 200w,\n/static/768a60aa512b34bb0c8b81652d5cfe1b/e17e5/try2.png 400w,\n/static/768a60aa512b34bb0c8b81652d5cfe1b/5a190/try2.png 800w,\n/static/768a60aa512b34bb0c8b81652d5cfe1b/c1b63/try2.png 1200w,\n/static/768a60aa512b34bb0c8b81652d5cfe1b/29007/try2.png 1600w,\n/static/768a60aa512b34bb0c8b81652d5cfe1b/8dcca/try2.png 2888w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">class Solution:\n    def smallestStringWithSwaps(self, s: str, pairs: List[List[int]]) -> str:\n        n = len(s)\n        graph = defaultdict(list)\n        for a,b in pairs:\n            graph[a].append(b)\n            graph[b].append(a)\n        \n        visited = [False] * n\n        res = list(s)\n\n        def dfs(i,component):\n            visited[i] = True\n            component.append(i)\n            for neighbor in graph[i]:\n                if not visited[neighbor]:\n                    dfs(neighbor, component)\n\n        for i in range(n):\n            if not visited[i]:\n                component = []\n                dfs(i, component)\n                chars = [s[j] for j in component]\n                chars.sort()\n                component.sort()\n                \n                for idx,char in zip(component, chars):\n                    res[idx] = char\n        \n        return ''.join(res)\n</code></pre>\n<h2>Complexity Analysis</h2>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 800px; \"\n    >\n      <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 54.49999999999999%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"tc\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/dbab30b9e2b9c37236928428d110ecad/5a190/tc.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/dbab30b9e2b9c37236928428d110ecad/772e8/tc.png 200w,\n/static/dbab30b9e2b9c37236928428d110ecad/e17e5/tc.png 400w,\n/static/dbab30b9e2b9c37236928428d110ecad/5a190/tc.png 800w,\n/static/dbab30b9e2b9c37236928428d110ecad/c1b63/tc.png 1200w,\n/static/dbab30b9e2b9c37236928428d110ecad/ddc6c/tc.png 1534w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n    </span></p>\n<h3>시간 복잡도</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>O(N + M log M) : N은 문자열의 길이, M은 각 폴더의 최대 길이</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>공간 복잡도</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>O(N + M) : N은 문자열의 길이,</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Constraint Analysis</h2>\n<pre><code>Constraints:\n1 &#x3C;= s.length &#x3C;= 10^5\n0 &#x3C;= pairs.length &#x3C;= 10^5\n0 &#x3C;= pairs[i][0], pairs[i][1] &#x3C; s.length\ns only contains lower case English letters.\n</code></pre>\n<h1>References</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/smallest-string-with-swaps/\">1202. Smallest String With Swaps - LeetCode</a></li>\n</ul>"}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/algorithm/LEET/L1202SmallestStringWithSwaps/"}},"staticQueryHashes":[],"slicesMap":{}}